ticking. Make it back before darkness falls… or face what comes for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/21108d32312d5eb39f12071371cd15bc.poster.avif?t=1762793647\" width=644 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/21108d32312d5eb39f12071371cd15bc.webm?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3809940/extras/21108d32312d5eb39f12071371cd15bc.mp4?t=1762793647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>FEATURES  </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅ A cozy-yet-tense platformer with tight design and satisfying digging <br>✅ Upgrade your drill, carry strength, health, and more <br>✅ Outsmart monsters and solve problems in underground encounters <br>✅ Feed and protect your egg - your future depends on it<br>✅ Simple, atmospheric story told without words<br>✅ A short, satisfying game loop of survival and care</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Drill Bird is a cozy-yet-tense digging platformer where every trip underground counts. Play as a bird fallen from the sky, in search for powerful ores to hatch your Egg. Get home before night falls, upgrade abilities, grow stronger, and unfold a sincere bird story about survival, care and purpose.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, French, German, Russian", "reviews": "“A cute, cozy and relaxing game that is perfect to take your mind of work and into tranquility.”<br />\r\nJohanna Österlind<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“An absolutely adorable experience about selflessly putting your life on the line providing for your offspring.”<br />\r\nJacob Lind<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass